`conduct with late notice` MEANS `The conduct after the loss` WITH
    `Tasco notified immediately`                                                     IS FALSE
    `day written notice was sent, counted from the day of the loss`                  IS NOTHING
    `police or local authority notified immediately`                                 IS TRUE
    `prevented by force majeure`                                                     IS FALSE
    `Tasco assessed the damage within that period`                                   IS FALSE
    `full rescue, mitigation and scene-preservation measures taken`                  IS TRUE
    `moved only for safety or on an authority's order`                               IS FALSE
    `moved, dismantled or repaired without Tasco's consent`                          IS FALSE
    `that was necessary for safety or ordered by an authority`                       IS FALSE
    `Tasco's opinion on dismantling was overdue`                                     IS FALSE
    `a third party is liable for the loss`                                           IS FALSE
    `right of claim preserved and transferred to Tasco with the file`                IS TRUE
    `cooperated with Tasco in recovering from the third party`                       IS TRUE
    `settled with the third party without Tasco's consent`                           IS FALSE
    `claim documents truthful`                                                       IS TRUE
    `cooperated in verifying the claim documents`                                    IS TRUE
    `proposal misstated the use of the vehicle, so too little premium was collected` IS FALSE
    `an increase in risk was not notified, so too little premium was collected`      IS FALSE
    `premium actually paid`                                                          IS 10_000_000
    `premium that should have been paid`                                             IS 10_000_000
    `the rate Tasco chose under 13.1.2`                                              IS NOTHING
    `the rate Tasco chose under 13.1.3`                                              IS NOTHING

`a passenger killed` MEANS `An accident to a person` WITH
    `role`                                                     IS `riding as a passenger`
    `under 7 years of age`                                     IS FALSE
    `outcome`                                                  IS `death`
    `accident directly connected with the use of the vehicle`  IS TRUE
    `on the vehicle, or getting on or off it, in road traffic` IS TRUE
    `person intentionally caused the accident`                 IS FALSE
    `percentage in the Decree's table`                         IS NOTHING
    `number of people on board, not counting children under 7` IS 4
    `circumstances`                                            IS `ordinary circumstances on the road`

`a passenger totally and permanently disabled` MEANS `An accident to a person` WITH
    `role`                                                     IS `riding as a passenger`
    `under 7 years of age`                                     IS FALSE
    `outcome`                                                  IS `permanent total disability`
    `accident directly connected with the use of the vehicle`  IS TRUE
    `on the vehicle, or getting on or off it, in road traffic` IS TRUE
    `person intentionally caused the accident`                 IS FALSE
    `percentage in the Decree's table`                         IS NOTHING
    `number of people on board, not counting children under 7` IS 4
    `circumstances`                                            IS `ordinary circumstances on the road`

