`goods cover of 200 million` MEANS `The goods liability cover` WITH
    `limit of liability` IS 200_000_000

`goods cover of 1 billion` MEANS `The goods liability cover` WITH
    `limit of liability` IS 1_000_000_000

`goods cover of 50 million` MEANS `The goods liability cover` WITH
    `limit of liability` IS 50_000_000

`goods lost when the lorry overturned` MEANS `A loss to goods carried` WITH
    `cause of the loss to the goods`                                                         IS `the vehicle hit, struck, overturned, fell over, fell or sank`
    `kind of goods`                                                                          IS `ordinary goods`
    `liability to the cargo owner under the Civil Code`                                      IS 50_000_000
    `costs of preventing or reducing the loss`                                               IS 2_000_000
    `costs of preserving, handling and storing the goods after the accident`                 IS 3_000_000
    `owner or driver failed to guard and preserve the goods`                                 IS FALSE
    `the whole vehicle was stolen with the goods`                                            IS FALSE
    `wrong kind, specification or marking`                                                   IS FALSE
    `unlawful circulation or seizure by the authorities`                                     IS FALSE
    `vehicle unsuitable for the goods`                                                       IS FALSE
    `natural deterioration, poor quality, packing, stowage or shifting not from a collision` IS FALSE
    `late delivery, wrong recipient, short or wrong delivery`                                IS FALSE
    `circumstances`                                                                          IS `ordinary circumstances on the road`
    `conduct after the loss`                                                                 IS `prompt and honest conduct`

