-- Chương III, IV and V tests. Expected values are worked from the source by hand.
-- HYPOTHETICAL figures: the compulsory limits (150 million a person, 100 million for property) and
-- the table percentages (100%, 10%) stand in for Decree 67/2023, which is not among the sources.

§ `Chương III — accident cover`

-- 24.1: death or permanent total disability, the whole 100,000,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a passenger killed` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 100_000_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a passenger totally and permanently disabled` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 100_000_000
-- 24.2: 10% from the table: 10,000,000. No percentage supplied: declined.
#ASSERT `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a passenger temporarily injured, 10% in the table` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 10_000_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a passenger temporarily injured, no table percentage` `people only` BECAUSE "art 24.2 pays by the table annexed to the compulsory insurance decree, and no percentage from it was supplied"
-- Permanent partial disability: Điều 24 names no benefit (finding X17).
#ASSERT REFUSED `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a passenger partially and permanently disabled` `people only` BECAUSE "art 24 names death, permanent total disability and temporary injury, and not permanent partial disability"
-- 24.4: a child under 7, 50% = 50,000,000; 8 aboard where 5 are insured, 5/8 = 62,500,000;
-- both, 50,000,000 x 5/8 = 31,250,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a child under 7 killed` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 50_000_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a passenger killed, 8 people on board` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 62_500_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a child under 7 killed, 8 people on board` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 31_250_000
-- Điều 21: a passenger hurt off the vehicle, a driver hurt in an accident unconnected with its use.
#ASSERT `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a passenger hurt off the vehicle` `people only` EQUALS `outside the cover` "art 21: the accident is not one the accident cover describes"
#ASSERT NOT `art 21 — the accident is within the cover` `a driver hurt in an accident unconnected with the vehicle's use`
-- Điều 23, then the general exclusions.
#ASSERT `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a passenger who caused the accident` `people only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 23 self-inflicted accident`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `an unlicensed driver killed` `people only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 11.2 driver's age or licence`)
-- Điều 11.4 reaches only damage to property: the drunk driver's death is paid (finding X1).
#ASSERT `the answer on the accident claim` `accident cover of 100 million a person for 5 people` `a drunk driver killed` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 100_000_000
#ASSERT `art 25 — the benefit is paid to` EQUALS "the insured person, or the insured person's lawful representative"

§ `Chương IV — goods liability`

-- Điều 29: 0,5% of 200 million is 1,000,000, the floor; of 1 billion, 5,000,000.
#ASSERT `art 29 — the deductible per loss` `goods cover of 200 million` EQUALS 1_000_000
#ASSERT `art 29 — the deductible per loss` `goods cover of 1 billion` EQUALS 5_000_000
#ASSERT `art 29 — the deductible per loss` `goods cover of 50 million` EQUALS 1_000_000
-- An overturn: 50,000,000 + 2,000,000 + 3,000,000 = 55,000,000, less 1,000,000 = 54,000,000;
-- under a 50 million limit, 50,000,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `goods lost when the lorry overturned` `goods only` EQUALS `payable` 54_000_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 50 million` `goods lost when the lorry overturned` `goods only` EQUALS `payable` 50_000_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `goods lost in a fire` `goods only` EQUALS `payable` 54_000_000
-- Late notice (Điều 13.1.1(a)): 54,000,000 x 90% = 48,600,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `goods lost, notice late` `goods only` EQUALS `payable` 48_600_000
-- Theft is not a peril of Điều 26, even with the whole lorry (finding X18).
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `goods stolen with the whole lorry` `goods only` EQUALS `outside the cover` "art 26: the loss to the goods was not caused by a peril it names"
-- Điều 27, 28, and Điều 11.4 (goods are property).
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `goods left unguarded` `goods only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 27.1 goods left unguarded`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `goods of the wrong kind` `goods only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 27.2 theft or wrong goods`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `goods seized by the authorities` `goods only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 27.3 unlawful circulation or seizure`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `goods in an unsuitable lorry` `goods only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 27.4 unsuitable vehicle`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `badly packed goods damaged in the overturn` `goods only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 27.5 nature, packing or stowage of goods`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `goods delivered late` `goods only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 27.6 late or wrong delivery`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `gold lost when the lorry overturned` `goods only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 28 special goods`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the goods claim` `goods cover of 200 million` `goods lost when a drunk driver overturned` `goods only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 11.4 alcohol or drugs`)

§ `Chương V — voluntary liability`

-- Bodily: 34.1, 100% x 100,000,000 x 60% = 60,000,000 (within the limit and the 250,000,000
-- paid); Điều 32, 250,000,000 - 150,000,000 = 100,000,000; the lesser, 60,000,000.
#ASSERT `art 34.1 — STBT for bodily injury` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a pedestrian killed, the owner 60% at fault and paying 250 million` EQUALS 60_000_000
#ASSERT `art 32 — the part of the owner's payment above the compulsory limit` `a pedestrian killed, the owner 60% at fault and paying 250 million` EQUALS 100_000_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a pedestrian killed, the owner 60% at fault and paying 250 million` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 60_000_000
-- Paying 180,000,000: Điều 32 gives 30,000,000; paying 100,000,000: nothing above the compulsory limit.
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a pedestrian killed, the owner paying 180 million` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 30_000_000
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a pedestrian killed, the owner paying 100 million` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 0
-- X19: on the formula of 34.1 alone, the same claim would pay 60,000,000.
#ASSERT `art 34.1 — STBT for bodily injury` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a pedestrian killed, the owner paying 100 million` EQUALS 60_000_000
-- Property: damage 300,000,000 x 50% = 150,000,000, paid 160,000,000: liability 150,000,000; less
-- the compulsory 100,000,000 = 50,000,000, within the 100,000,000 limit.
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a shop front damaged by 300 million, the owner half at fault and paying 160 million` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 50_000_000
-- Điều 30, 33.
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a claim with no compulsory insurance at Tasco` `people only` EQUALS `outside the cover` "art 30: the owner holds no compulsory liability insurance with Tasco in force"
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a claim outside Vietnam` `people only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 33.1 outside Vietnam`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a claim the decree excludes` `people only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 33.2 excluded by the compulsory insurance decree`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a claim with a certificate lapsed by a roof rack` `people only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 33.3 no valid inspection certificate`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a claim after a red light` `people only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 33.4 prohibited road or manoeuvre`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a claim while racing` `people only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 33.5 racing, unlawful towing or goods`)
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a claim in a riot` `people only` EQUALS `excluded` (LIST `art 33.6 war, terrorism or riot`)
-- Điều 33 names no alcohol exclusion; with the decree's exclusions supplied as not firing, paid.
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a claim with a drunk driver` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 60_000_000
-- Điều 13 applies to Chương V: late notice, 60,000,000 x 90% = 54,000,000.
#ASSERT `the answer on the third-party claim` `voluntary cover of 100 million a person and 100 million for property` `a claim with late notice` `people only` EQUALS `payable` 54_000_000
